  "details": "\"Udon UI\" is an upcoming feature for VRChat's Worlds SDK.\n\nIt allows the creation of a user interface (UI) with buttons, images, lists, and text related to the current world. This UI can be displayed in the world or in VRChat's quick menu.\n\nUdon UI will make it easier to create a unified UI for VRChat worlds. Options such as teleport, mirror toggles, or preferences can be added to VRChat's quick menu, which was not possible before.",
